  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I just want to give an idea for the game. My idea is that there could be a mode to play with the phone and vr box,connecting a controller (Xbox,PlayStation,etc) and a phone to the PC or laptop. Here's how it could be made:\n\nStep 1:\nMake a mode for the phone that has the same things as the vr head set(movement and stuff)\n\nStep 2:\nMake a mode to use a controller to control the avatar\n(Grab stuff,sitting down,look around with the joystick,etc)\n\nStep 3:\nPut the phone in the vr box and be able to move the head of the avatar\n(Look up and the avatar will look up and that stuff)\n\nThis could work for the people that doesn't have money for a vr headset,but if they have a vr box for the phone and a controller of PlayStation or Xbox,that could be a solution for them.\n\nThank you for reading this message and I hope you'd consider it.",
